<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css">
</head>
<body class="article toc2 toc-right">
<div id="header">
<h1>Management resources</h1>
<div id="toc" class="toc2">
<div id="toctitle">Table of Contents</div>
<ul class="sectlevel1">
<li><a href="#overview">Overview</a>
<ul class="sectlevel2">
<li><a href="#authorization">Authorization</a></li>
<li><a href="#conventions">Conventions</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="#resources">Resources</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-app">server:app</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-index">server:index</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-repo">server:repo</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-export">server:export</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-dump">server:dump</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-snapshot">server:snapshot</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-system">server:system</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-auditlog">server:auditlog</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-project">server:project</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-content">server:content</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-task">server:task</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-scheduler">server:scheduler</a></li>
<li><a href="#server-idprovider">server:idprovider</a></li>
<li><a href="#legacy">Legacy REST API</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div id="content">
<div id="preamble">
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p><span class="image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="64" height="20"><linearGradient id="s" x2="0" y2="100%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#bbb" stop-opacity=".1"/><stop offset="1" stop-opacity=".1"/></linearGradient><clipPath id="r"><rect width="64" height="20" rx="3" fill="#fff"/></clipPath><g clip-path="url(#r)"><rect width="25" height="20" fill="#555"/><rect x="25" width="39" height="20" fill="#007ec6"/><rect width="64" height="20" fill="url(#s)"/></g><g fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Verdana,Geneva,DejaVu Sans,sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" font-size="110"><text x="135" y="150" fill="#010101" fill-opacity=".3" transform="scale(.1)" textLength="150">XP</text><text x="135" y="140" transform="scale(.1)" textLength="150">XP</text><text x="435" y="150" fill="#010101" fill-opacity=".3" transform="scale(.1)" textLength="290">8.2.0</text><text x="435" y="140" transform="scale(.1)" textLength="290">8.2.0</text></g></svg></span> Resource-oriented management APIs on the management endpoint (port 4848), with per-resource, per-verb exposure control from virtual host configuration.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="overview"><a class="link" href="#overview">Overview</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Every management operation is exposed as a <strong>resource</strong> with a fixed set of <strong>verbs</strong>: <code>list</code>, <code>get</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>delete</code>, <code>load</code>, <code>restore</code>, <code>prune</code>, <code>watch</code>. A resource is an API on the management endpoint, addressed by its descriptor key at the root of the port:</p>
</div>
<div class="literalblock">
<div class="content">
<pre>http://localhost:4848/server:snapshot</pre>
</div>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>The <a href="../management.ahtml">legacy REST API</a> (<code>repo/snapshot/list</code>, <code>system/dump</code>, &#8230;&#8203;) is unchanged. A <a href="../../config/vhosts.ahtml#management-api-policy">virtual host</a> selects which resources and verbs it exposes, and can switch the legacy paths off.</p>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="authorization"><a class="link" href="#authorization">Authorization</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Same as the rest of the management endpoint: an authenticated user with the <code>system.admin</code> role, by <a href="../../security/service-accounts.ahtml#jwt-authentication">service account JWT</a> or basic authentication. See <a href="../management.ahtml#authorization">Authorization</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="conventions"><a class="link" href="#conventions">Conventions</a></h3>
<div class="ulist">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Queries are <code>GET</code> and take no body. A collection is read at the resource root (<code>GET /server:repo</code>), an item by name (<code>GET /server:repo/{repo}</code>).</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Commands are <code>POST</code> with a JSON body (or <code>PUT</code> when they replace the state of an item, <code>DELETE</code> when they remove one). A command naming an existing item puts the name in the path: <code>POST /server:dump/{name}/load</code>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Long-running commands return <code>202 Accepted</code> with the id of a task to poll through <code>server:task</code>. Except for <code>server:content</code> <code>sync</code>, every such command is a cluster task of the system application (<code>com.enonic.xp.app.system:dump</code>, <code>:export</code>, <code>:reindex</code>, &#8230;&#8203;) and runs on any node of the cluster. In a cluster, <code>$XP_HOME/data</code> and the snapshot location must be on a file system shared by all nodes:</p>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-json" data-lang="json">{"taskId": "d9f3b1e4-..."}</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</li>
<li>
<p>Errors are JSON with the status and a message:</p>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-json" data-lang="json">{"status": 403, "message": "Verb [restore] of API [server:snapshot] is not exposed on this virtual host"}</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>404</code> for an unknown path or item, <code>405</code> for a wrong method, <code>400</code> for an invalid body, <code>403</code> when the virtual host does not expose the verb.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li>
<p>Some paths have an <strong>alias</strong>, the name the operation had before. An alias behaves exactly like the path it aliases and belongs to the same verb: a virtual host that exposes <code>prune</code> on <code>server:system</code> exposes both <code>/server:system/prune</code> and <code>/server:system/vacuum</code>, and one that does not exposes neither.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="resources"><a class="link" href="#resources">Resources</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 20%;">
<col style="width: 20%;">
<col style="width: 60%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Resource</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verbs</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Purpose</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-app"><code>server:app</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code>, <code>install</code>, <code>pull</code>, <code>uninstall</code>, <code>start</code>, <code>stop</code>, <code>watch</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Installed applications. <code>install</code> takes an uploaded bundle; <code>pull</code> fetches the bundle from a URL.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-index"><code>server:index</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>get</code>, <code>update</code>, <code>reindex</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">The search and storage indices of a repository: replica counts, and rebuilding the search index.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-repo"><code>server:repo</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code>, <code>get</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Repository inventory.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-export"><code>server:export</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>load</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Node exports under <code>$XP_HOME/data/export</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-dump"><code>server:dump</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>load</code>, <code>upgrade</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">System dumps under <code>$XP_HOME/data/dump</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-snapshot"><code>server:snapshot</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>restore</code>, <code>prune</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Repository snapshots.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-system"><code>server:system</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>prune</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Installation-wide maintenance (vacuum).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-auditlog"><code>server:auditlog</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>prune</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Audit log retention.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-project"><code>server:project</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Content projects with their sites.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-content"><code>server:content</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>sync</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Syncing inherited content from parent projects into child projects.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-task"><code>server:task</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code>, <code>get</code>, <code>watch</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">The tasks the commands above hand out ids for.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-scheduler"><code>server:scheduler</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code>, <code>get</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>delete</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Scheduled jobs.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#server-idprovider"><code>server:idprovider</code></a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">ID providers, as virtual hosts refer to them.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Universal APIs of installed applications with <code>mount: "management"</code> sit beside these, at <code>/&lt;application&gt;:&lt;api&gt;</code>, and are subject to the same <a href="../../config/vhosts.ahtml#management-api-policy">virtual host policy</a> if they choose to honour it - see <a href="https://developer.enonic.com/docs/xp/stable/code/web/apis.ahtml#management-endpoint">Universal APIs on the management endpoint</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-app"><a class="link" href="#server-app">server:app</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Installed applications.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:app</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">All installed applications with state and version: <code>{"applications": [&#8230;&#8203;]}</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>install</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:app/install</code> (multipart, field <code>file</code>)</p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Installs the uploaded application bundle. Returns the application.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>pull</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:app/pull</code><br>
alias <code>/server:app/installUrl</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Fetches and installs an application from <code>URL</code>; <code>sha512</code> holds the expected digest. The URL must match the allow-list in <a href="../../config/system.ahtml#management-app"><code>com.enonic.xp.server.management.app.cfg</code></a>, which also sets whether <code>sha512</code> is required. That policy applies regardless of the virtual host the request arrived on.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>uninstall</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:app/uninstall</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Uninstalls the applications named in <code>key</code> (a list).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>start</code>, <code>stop</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:app/start</code>, <code>POST /server:app/stop</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Starts or stops the applications named in <code>key</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>watch</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:app/watch</code> (SSE)<br>
alias <code>/server:app/events</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Server-sent events: a <code>list</code> event on connect, then <code>installed</code>, <code>state</code> and <code>uninstalled</code> events as applications change.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="title">Pull an application</div>
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-json" data-lang="json">POST /server:app/pull
{
  "URL": "https://repo.enonic.com/public/com/enonic/app/contentstudio/6.0.0/contentstudio-6.0.0.jar",
  "sha512": "5b3c..."
}</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-index"><a class="link" href="#server-index">server:index</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>The two Elasticsearch indices of a repository: <code>search</code>, holding the searchable representation, and <code>storage</code>, holding versions, branches and commits. The API exposes their replica settings.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>get</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:index/{repo}</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Replica settings of both indices.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>update</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>PUT /server:index/{repo}</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Replaces the replica settings of both indices. Both keys are required. A value is either a number of replicas as a string (<code>"2"</code>) or an Elasticsearch auto-expand range (<code>"0-all"</code>, <code>"0-1"</code>); any other value is rejected with <code>400</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>reindex</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:index/{repo}/reindex</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Rebuilds the search index from storage. <code>branches</code> limits the rebuild (default: every branch of the repository); <code>initialize: true</code> drops the index first. Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="title">Replicas</div>
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-json" data-lang="json">GET /server:index/com.enonic.cms.default

{"replicas": {"search": "1", "storage": "0-all"}}</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="title">Reindex the master branch</div>
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-json" data-lang="json">POST /server:index/com.enonic.cms.default/reindex
{"branches": ["master"], "initialize": false}</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
<div class="admonitionblock note">
<table>
<tr>
<td class="icon">
<i class="fa icon-note" title="Note"></i>
</td>
<td class="content">
Index settings other than replicas are not exposed.
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-repo"><a class="link" href="#server-repo">server:repo</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:repo</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Every repository with its branches: <code>{"repositories": [{"id": "&#8230;&#8203;", "branches": ["draft", "master"]}]}</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>get</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:repo/{repo}</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">One repository.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-export"><a class="link" href="#server-export">server:export</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Exports of a repository path, written to and read from <code>$XP_HOME/data/export/&lt;name&gt;.zip</code>. The API names an export without the <code>.zip</code> suffix; an archive copied into the directory under that name is what <code>load</code> reads.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:export</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">The exports on disk: <code>{"exports": [{"name": "&#8230;&#8203;"}]}</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>create</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:export</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Exports <code>sourceRepoPath</code> (<code>&lt;repository&gt;:&lt;branch&gt;:&lt;path&gt;</code>) as <code>exportName</code>. Optional <code>batchSize</code>. Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>load</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:export/{name}/load</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Imports the export into <code>targetRepoPath</code>. Optional <code>importWithIds</code> and <code>importWithPermissions</code> (default <code>true</code>). No XSLT transformation is applied; the legacy <code>xslSource</code> and <code>xslParams</code> keys are accepted and ignored. Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="title">Export and load</div>
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-json" data-lang="json">POST /server:export
{"sourceRepoPath": "com.enonic.cms.default:draft:/content/mysite", "exportName": "mysite"}

POST /server:export/mysite/load
{"targetRepoPath": "com.enonic.cms.staging:draft:/content", "importWithIds": true}</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-dump"><a class="link" href="#server-dump">server:dump</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>System dumps under <code>$XP_HOME/data/dump/&lt;name&gt;</code>.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:dump</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">The dumps on disk with timestamp, version and size.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>create</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:dump</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Dumps all repositories (or <code>repositories</code>) as <code>name</code>. <code>includeVersions</code>, <code>maxAge</code>, <code>maxVersions</code> as for the legacy API. Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>load</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:dump/{name}/load</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Loads the dump, replacing the current data. Optional body: <code>upgrade</code>, <code>repositories</code>. Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>upgrade</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:dump/{name}/upgrade</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Upgrades the dump on disk to the current model version. Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-snapshot"><a class="link" href="#server-snapshot">server:snapshot</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:snapshot</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Every snapshot in the snapshot repository.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>create</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:snapshot</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Snapshots all repositories, or <code>repositoryId</code>. Optional <code>snapshotName</code>. Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>restore</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:snapshot/{name}/restore</code><br>
<code>POST /server:snapshot/restore</code> with <code>{"latest": true}</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Restores a snapshot, replacing the current data. Optional <code>repository</code>, <code>force</code>. Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>prune</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>DELETE /server:snapshot/{name}</code><br>
<code>DELETE /server:snapshot?before=&lt;ISO date-time&gt;</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Deletes one snapshot, or every snapshot taken before an instant.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-system"><a class="link" href="#server-system">server:system</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>prune</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:system/prune</code><br>
alias <code>/server:system/vacuum</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Removes unused blobs and old versions. Optional <code>ageThreshold</code> (ISO duration, e.g. <code>PT48H</code>) and <code>tasks</code> (the vacuum tasks to run). Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-auditlog"><a class="link" href="#server-auditlog">server:auditlog</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>prune</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:auditlog/prune</code><br>
alias <code>/server:auditlog/cleanup</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Deletes audit log records older than <code>ageThreshold</code> (ISO duration, required). Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-project"><a class="link" href="#server-project">server:project</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:project</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Every content project with its <code>draft</code> and <code>master</code> branches and the sites on each.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-content"><a class="link" href="#server-content">server:content</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>sync</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:content/sync</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Syncs inherited content from parent projects into child projects, parents first. Optional <code>projects</code> limits the sync to the named projects; without it every project is synced. Runs as a local task on the node that received the request. Returns a task.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="title">Sync two projects</div>
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-json" data-lang="json">POST /server:content/sync
{"projects": ["intranet", "intranet-no"]}</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-task"><a class="link" href="#server-task">server:task</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:task</code><br>
<code>GET /server:task?running=true</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">All tasks on the cluster, or only the running ones.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>get</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:task/{id}</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">State, progress and description of one task - the id every <code>202</code> response returns.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>watch</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:task/watch</code> (SSE)<br>
<code>GET /server:task/{id}/watch</code> (SSE)<br>
alias <code>/events</code> for both</p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Server-sent events. Without an id: a <code>list</code> event on connect whose data is <code>{"tasks": [...]}</code>, the shape of <code>list</code>, then <code>submitted</code>, <code>updated</code>, <code>finished</code>, <code>failed</code> and <code>removed</code> events for every task on the cluster. With an id: a <code>task</code> event with the task on connect, then the events of that task. The data of every event but <code>list</code> has the shape of <code>get</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="title">Watch one task</div>
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code>GET /server:task/d9f3b1e4-.../watch
Accept: text/event-stream

event: task
data: {"id":"d9f3b1e4-...","state":"RUNNING","progress":{"current":3,"total":10,"info":""},...}

event: finished
data: {"id":"d9f3b1e4-...","state":"FINISHED",...}</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-scheduler"><a class="link" href="#server-scheduler">server:scheduler</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:scheduler</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Every scheduled job: <code>{"jobs": [&#8230;&#8203;]}</code>, each with <code>name</code>, <code>descriptor</code>, <code>calendar</code>, <code>enabled</code>, <code>config</code>, <code>user</code>, <code>lastRun</code>, <code>lastTaskId</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>get</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:scheduler/{name}</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">One scheduled job.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>create</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST /server:scheduler</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Creates a job. <code>name</code>, <code>descriptor</code> (the task to run) and <code>schedule</code> are required; <code>description</code>, <code>config</code> (the task&#8217;s config), <code>enabled</code> (default <code>true</code>) and <code>user</code> (the principal the task runs as) are optional. <code>schedule.type</code> is <code>CRON</code> (<code>value</code> a cron expression, <code>timeZone</code> required), <code>ONE_TIME</code> (<code>value</code> an ISO instant, optional <code>deleteAfterRun</code>) or <code>FIXED_RATE</code> (<code>value</code> an ISO duration). Returns <code>201</code> with the job.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>delete</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>DELETE /server:scheduler/{name}</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Deletes the job.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="title">Dump every night at 03:00</div>
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-json" data-lang="json">POST /server:scheduler
{
  "name": "nightly-dump",
  "descriptor": "com.enonic.xp.app.system:dump",
  "schedule": {"type": "CRON", "value": "0 3 * * *", "timeZone": "Europe/Oslo"},
  "config": {"name": "nightly", "includeVersions": true},
  "user": "user:system:su"
}</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="server-idprovider"><a class="link" href="#server-idprovider">server:idprovider</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 14.2857%;">
<col style="width: 28.5714%;">
<col style="width: 57.1429%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Verb</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Request</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET /server:idprovider</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Every id provider: <code>key</code>, <code>displayName</code>, <code>description</code> and the <code>applicationKey</code> of the application implementing it. The provider configuration is never included.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="legacy"><a class="link" href="#legacy">Legacy REST API</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>The <a href="../management.ahtml">legacy endpoints</a> are unchanged. They map to the resources as follows:</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 33.3333%;">
<col style="width: 33.3333%;">
<col style="width: 33.3334%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Legacy</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Resource</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Note</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST app/install</code>, <code>app/installUrl</code>, <code>app/start</code>, <code>app/stop</code>, <code>app/uninstall</code>, <code>GET app/events</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:app</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>installUrl</code> and <code>events</code> remain as aliases of <code>pull</code> and <code>watch</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST repo/index/reindexTask</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:index</code> <code>reindex</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST repo/index/reindex</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">-</p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><strong>Deprecated.</strong> Synchronous; use <code>server:index</code> <code>reindex</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST repo/index/updateSettings</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:index</code> <code>update</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><strong>Deprecated.</strong> Only replicas are exposed through <code>server:index</code> <code>update</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET repo/list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:repo</code> <code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST repo/export</code>, <code>repo/import</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:export</code> <code>create</code>, <code>load</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Listing exports is new.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET system/dump</code>, <code>POST system/dump</code>, <code>system/load</code>, <code>system/upgrade</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:dump</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST repo/snapshot</code>, <code>repo/snapshot/restore</code>, <code>repo/snapshot/delete</code>, <code>GET repo/snapshot/list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:snapshot</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST system/vacuum</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:system</code> <code>prune</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>vacuum</code> remains as an alias.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST auditlog/cleanup</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:auditlog</code> <code>prune</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>cleanup</code> remains as an alias.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET content/projects/list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:project</code> <code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>POST content/syncAll</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:content</code> <code>sync</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>sync</code> accepts a list of projects.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET task/{taskId}</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:task</code> <code>get</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Listing and watching tasks are new.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET idproviders/list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:idprovider</code> <code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET scheduler/list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>server:scheduler</code> <code>list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>get</code>, <code>create</code> and <code>delete</code> are new.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>GET webapps/list</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">-</p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Not migrated; installed applications are node state.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
